<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australand lists on ASX at A$1.51.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australand lists on ASX at A$1.51.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in property development group Australand Holdings Ltd made its debut on the Australian Stock Exchange at A$1.51 on Monday, a 25.8 percent premium to the A$1.20 offer price.</p>
<p>Singapore's property and hotel group DBS Land has said it would remain Australand's main shareholder with 63.4 percent of the shares held through its two subsidiaries Austvale Holdings Ltd and Ausprop Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Australand was also due to list on the Stock Exchange of Singapore later on Monday.</p>
</text>
